  "description": "TerraPDF is a free, open-source (MIT) C# PDF library for .NET. Generate PDF\n      documents such as invoices, reports, receipts, labels, certificates, and\n      statements from code with a fluent, composable API. Lightweight, zero-dependency,\n      and pure managed C#: no native binaries and no HTML-to-PDF browser engine.\n      Features include rich text styling, multi-span formatting, Column / Row / Table\n      layouts, PNG and JPEG images, borders, page breaks, hyperlinks, headers, footers,\n      page numbers, AES-256 encryption, Code128 barcodes, QR codes, custom TrueType\n      font embedding with automatic subsetting, vector graphics with text labels and\n      constant-alpha transparency, full Unicode support, and cross-platform .NET 8, 9,\n      and 10 support.",
